   "MatterHistoryActionName": "elected",
   "MatterHistoryActionText": "The President called for an election to fill one vacancy on the Contract and Compliance Board for a non-voting member of the Metropolitan Council. Nominations previously made were CM Deonté Harrell. The following vote was taken on the nominated candidates: Deonté Harrell (34): Suara, Porterfield, Evans-Segall, Allen, Hill, Kimbrough, Toombs, Gamble, Cortese, Capp, Benedict, Harrell, Webb, Eslick, Evans, Bradford, Huffman, Gregg, Welsch, Vo, Cash, Kupin, Taylor, Gadd, Preptit, Johnston, Nash, Benton, Ellis, Sepulveda, Rutherford, Styles, Ewing, and Spain; Abstain (0). The president declared that Deonté Harrell was elected to the Board.",
